# HuggingFace read token (https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens)
# 
# To get the best Quran ASR model (Muno459/fastconformer-quran), you
# need a HuggingFace read token AND you must accept the model's terms:
#   1. Visit https://huggingface.co/Muno459/fastconformer-quran
#   2. Click "Agree and access repository" (accepts the license)
#   3. Create a read token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
#      (read-only is enough — no need to give it write access)
#   4. Paste it on the line below and save as hf_token.txt (no .example)
#
# Example content of hf_token.txt:
#   hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# If you don't create this file, the build will fall back to the
# public mohammed/fastconformer-quran-ar model (works for Alafasy but
# not for other reciters).
